      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE DARK NIGHT (1) drew a wide gate last start and was safely held, beaten 40 metres into ninth at Gloucester Park over 1730m. Will enjoy a nice run from this more favourable starting position. Has the talent to find the winners' list. REDDY TO FLY (9) produced yet another strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2242m at Narrogin, adding to a string of recent minor placings. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Good enough to put himself in the winners' stall. LIL MISS DELIGHT (3) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 2130m at Gloucester Park a week ago. SPORTING GRACE (7) disappointed last time when seventh over 1177m at Pinjarra. Can do a lot better so worth considering.",
